<title>JAPAN: Bank of Japan drains 300 bln yen from market.</title>
<headline>Bank of Japan drains 300 bln yen from market.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Japan (BOJ) drained a net 300 billion yen from the money market by offering to sell 300 billion yen in commercial bills on Monday, money traders said.</p>
<p>---Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-8676</p>
